`verilator_config
// Vyges lint waiver (vyges-additions) — canakari
//
// llc2.v: the connecting net `equal_i` (joins the `.equal` ports of two
// submodules) is not declared, so Verilator creates it implicitly (1-bit).
// Functionally correct; lint-style omission upstream. Reported upstream as a
// question. Waive IMPLICIT for this file only.
// Upstream issue: https://github.com/FHDO-ICLAB/Canakari/issues/1
lint_off -rule IMPLICIT -file "*llc2.v"
